tasks.description:
explain the choice of the illustrations for the project by briefly describing them and noting the differences;
mention the advantages (1–2) of the two different styles to dress;
mention the disadvantages (1–2) of the two different styles to dress;
express your opinion on the subject of the project – which style of clothes you prefer and why.

You will speak for not more than 3 minutes (12–15 sentences). You have to talk continuously
